             GITIME, TIMEZONE, DELIVERY, LOGICALSYSTEM2, MATERIALDOCEWM, CUSTOMSREFNO, ENHSTORERET, ADVRETURNS,
             DOCCONDITION, CANCELINFULL, DELIVERYTYPE)
