  REFDOCITEM, MATDOCYEAR2, MATERIALDOC2, MATDOCITEM2, DELIVCOMPL, TEXT, EQUIPMENT, RECIPIENT, UNLOADINGPOINT, BUSINESSAREA,
  COAREA, TRDGPARTBA, CLEARINGCOCODE, COSTCENTER, NOTINUSE, ORDER, ASSET, SUBNUMBER, CCTPOSTINGSTAT, ORDPOSTSTAT,
  PROJPOSTSTAT, PAPOSTSTAT, FISCALYEAR, POSTPREVPER, PSTTOPRYEAR, COMPANYCODE, DOCUMENTNUMBER, LINEITEM,
